    "text": "Democrats don't see welfare fraud as fraud: For the Dems, poor people have it coming to them. It's a form of reparations, because \"poor people are only poor because of racist white supremacist privilege,\" and \"it's not the poors' fault that they're poor.\" So every claim for welfare should be honored without examination (\"Why would decent poor people lie?\") And if you question the claim, and they complain, then you risk being fired for being cruel to poor people. Needless to say, people from foreign cultures where everyone is automatically corrupt and cheats the system at every opportunity; when they get here and see how easy it is to cheat, say \"Please Sir. I want some more.\" And in Democrat America, they get it.",
